  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **One In Seven**: back after 30 archived shows (735 days) [3]\n- **Spark**: back after 25 archived shows (651 days) [3]\n- **Soulful Strut**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **Limbs Of A Pine**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **At The Show**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **The In Crowd**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **soulive2015-03-21.cmc622xt.sbd.matrix.flac24** (recommended): matrix (soundboard mixed with audience mics); 11 songs; 157 min [1]\n- **soulive2015-03-21.cmc622xt.sbd.matrix.flac16**: matrix (soundboard mixed with audience mics); 11 songs; 157 min [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- The show was Night 8 of the Bowlive VI run at Brooklyn Bowl [1]\n- The show was Night 8 of Bowlive VI at Brooklyn Bowl [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **soulive2015-03-21.cmc622xt.sbd.matrix.flac24**: taped by Eric McRoberts; transferred by Eric McRoberts; source: On Stage Audience/SBD Matrix [1]. Also: Two sources were mixed: an on-stage Schoeps cmc622xt mic feed and a soundboard feed from a Digidesign/Avid Profile, both recorded at 24/96; Chain ran through Sonosax SX-M2, Apogee Mini-Me and Sound Devices 744T, then time-aligned in SoundForge and mixed in Vegas Pro 13 [1]\n- **soulive2015-03-21.cmc622xt.sbd.matrix.flac16**: taped by Eric McRoberts; transferred by Eric McRoberts; source: On Stage Audience/SBD Matrix [2]. Also: Matrix of on-stage Schoeps cmc622xt mics and a Digidesign/Avid Profile soundboard feed, both captured at 24/96 on a Sound Devices 744T; This 16-bit version was made by downsampling to 44.1 kHz with iZotope SRC and dithering, then converting to FLAC; Eric McRoberts recorded and mixed it [2]",
